msgid "set :ref:`TERRAIN_ENABLE<TERRAIN_ENABLE>` to 1"
msgstr "将 :ref:`TERRAIN_ENABLE<TERRAIN_ENABLE>` 设置为 1"

#: ../../source/docs/terrain-following.rst:102
