#: ../../source/docs/terrain-following.rst:103
#: af5f173215c64ccd9b19de935d33639d
msgid ""
"set :ref:`TERRAIN_CACHE_SZ<TERRAIN_CACHE_SZ>` to 60 to load more tiles into "
