#: ../../source/docs/terrain-following.rst:106
#: 68a815aa5e4e459bbe5e3dcefede1cdb
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "警告"

#: ../../source/docs/terrain-following.rst:108
#: 09034e01b67b4f1ea3264073870a2b6b
msgid ""
"When planning missions containing commands with different altitudes-above-"
"terrain keep in mind that the vehicle's altitude-above-terrain will "
"gradually change between the waypoints.  I.e. it will not immediately climb "
"or descend to the new target altitude-above-terrain as it starts towards the"
" next waypoint."
msgstr ""
"在规划包含不同离地高度命令的任务时，请记住飞行器的离地高度将在航点之间逐渐变化，即它不会在开始飞向下一个航点时立即爬升或下降到新的目标离地高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/terrain-following.rst:110
#: 2757593fe8d5468da96e941d929a0321
msgid ""
"In practice it is best to set the initial take-off command's altitude high "
"enough to clear obstacles."
msgstr "实际操作中，最好将初始起飞命令的高度设置得足够高以清除障碍物。"

